<description>&lt;p&gt;The Venezuelan army bombed an ELN guerrilla camp in Apure, killing at least 19 rebels, and a U.S. drone strike hit an ELN drug depot nearby, causing at least 20 deaths. The United States is negotiating a long-term military presence in Venezuela and Trump has floated a one-day operation to capture Maduro, while a U.S. soldier faces court after being arrested for betting on Maduro's removal. Oliver Blanco met a U.S. official in Washington as the negotiations continue. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/03/world/americas/us-venezuela-strike-eln-drug-trafficking.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOb19kbjZoNTBPaGNqNUFKeFZYR2dzOWlNN0ZfS0hRUC1zWUR5TWgwM3pnWmtTSGNDcEsybFVwUktHY1BSQ0pxOTdvLVZFbC1Gc25KVjBLbWNUZTVOejhpZjhUajU2emRCSU1CZHVkdU44Znh2b21WQnhPTWM5YllzM2kwSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQV2JtLTUxR2RiTmlwNnljTDdjcDVjeHVkYVg0QktsS0tiUVhCOVBWMGNfejJTbG1MNUNOQ2lFZnhla3hGTDJ2eVFXRG14Yjk3am8wM3gyQ3E5b1ZGRzNoalJMQ0I1MXUxbDdUMkRJdmZucFNXWTFFTkZUN3Vpc0FVeWRiYzM0Sno1cS1JNTZrTG1BbmRiQk54Z3RuWllZOF96NjkyZkRoQzdvYWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNWk8xbVpKVVo3aDJVZjZSa2pBOXB3SnNmam5iYlltcC01aWh2Z01oNEZRNmxMcTlsbkhZV2hMc1h0NzFiLXQyNWlxNTZIZDYxQ01sYTF2TTB5X0lsMGRIVVR1Ym9SODVaOXZQc1VGeXBPYk1GaUU5NDUzMVNERWkwa0JTX1haSmMyQWFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQaUU3c3kzaXIzYm5CUUQ5aklqZDkwZV9nU051LTVhejdaYU9UZUxQSnJOelpNcjhnWGxEeG5LNlY0TGQ4bUxqV1p